# Command-Line Study Tracker

A beginner Python project that records study time and the subjects studied.

## Current features

- Converts minutes into hours and remaining minutes
- Displays a menu of subjects
- Allows the user to select multiple subjects
- Displays a summary of the study session

## Concepts practiced

- Variables and functions
- Conditionals
- While loops
- Lists and dictionaries
- User input
- Return values
- String formatting

## Current limitation

Entering text when a number is expected causes an error.

## Next step

Add exception handling for invalid inputs.
